{%- comment -%}
Metric/imperial switch. Wired by _js/units.js, which also remembers the choice.
Server-rendered values are metric, so this starts on km.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="unit-toggle" data-unit-toggle role="group" aria-label="Measurement units">
  <button type="button" class="is-active" data-units="metric" aria-pressed="true">km</button>
  <button type="button" data-units="imperial" aria-pressed="false">mi</button>
</div>
